9. Subjects with active tuberculosis (TB) who are receiving anti-tuberculosis treatment or have received anti-tuberculosis treatment within 1 year before screening;
10. Subjects who are positive in the treponema pallidum serology test;
11. Subjects with the medical history of known human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) positive or known acquired immunodeficiency syndrome (AIDS);
